      "citation_path": "us-ma/guidance/dta/policy-online/snap/child-support-expenses-deduction",
      "metadata": {
        "authority_role": "DTA operational policy on child support expenses: legally obligated child support paid for a nonhousehold member is subtracted from gross income for the gross income test (the page cites 106 CMR 364.370 for that test) and then allowed as a deduction in the SNAP benefit calculation. The same exclusion is codified at 106 CMR 363.230(O) (us-ma/regulation/106-cmr/363/230).",
